        {
          "changesDescription": "Upgrade `react-router-dom` from 6.30 to 7.18, which fixes GHSA-wrjc-x8rr-h8h6 and GHSA-337j-9hxr-rhxg; no 6.x release carries these fixes. React Router 7 requires React 18 or later.",
