        {
          "changesDescription": "The date field's time picker now follows `timeFormat`. A format with a 24-hour hour token, such as `HH:mm`, opens a 24-hour picker with no AM/PM select. 12-hour formats and `timeFormat: true` keep the 12-hour picker.",
